---
<footer class="footer-outer-shell">
    <div class="footer-shell site-layout">
        <div class="footer-brand">
            <a href="#top" class="footer-mark hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
                <img src="/img/presek_emblem.svg?v=3" alt="ПРЕСЕК.мк Емблем" class="h-6 sm:h-8 site-logo" />
                <img src="/logo.svg?v=3" alt="ПРЕСЕК.мк" class="h-8 sm:h-12 site-logo" />
            </a>
            <p class="footer-description">Пресек ги собира вестите на едно место, ги групира по тема и ви покажува каде изворите се совпаѓаат, а каде се разликуваат.</p>
        </div>

        <nav class="footer-nav">
            <a href="/archive">Архива</a>
            <a href="/izvori">Извори</a>
            <a href="/pulse">Пулс</a>
            <a href="/about">За проектот</a>
            <a href="/editorial">Стандарди</a>
            <a href="/support" class="text-nyt-accent !opacity-100">Поддржи го проектот</a>
            <a href="/contact">Контакт</a>
            <a href="/privacy">Приватност</a>
            <a href="/terms">Услови</a>
        </nav>

        <p class="footer-meta">
            © 2026 ПРЕСЕК.мк.
        </p>
    </div>
</footer>

<style>
    .footer-outer-shell {
        margin-top: var(--section-py);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: var(--background);
    }

    .footer-shell {
        padding-top: var(--section-py);
        padding-bottom: var(--page-py);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 2rem;
        align-items: start;
    }

    .footer-brand {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;
    }

    .footer-mark {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        opacity: 0.75;
    }

    .footer-description,
    .footer-meta {
        margin: 0;
        max-width: 40rem;
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        letter-spacing: 0.03em;
        color: var(--muted-foreground);
    }

    .footer-nav {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
    }

    .footer-nav a {
        text-decoration: none;
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--foreground);
        opacity: 0.6;
        transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }

    .footer-nav a:hover {
        opacity: 1;
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 4px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 960px) {
        .footer-shell {
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) auto;
        }

        .footer-meta {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
    }

    @media (max-width: 639px) {
        .footer-outer-shell {
            margin-top: calc(var(--section-py) * 0.7);
        }
        .footer-shell {
            gap: 1.25rem;
            padding-top: calc(var(--section-py) * 0.7);
            padding-bottom: calc(var(--page-py) * 0.7);
        }
        .footer-brand {
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }
        .footer-description {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .footer-nav {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 0.55rem 0.85rem;
        }
        .footer-nav a {
            font-size: 0.6rem;
        }
        .footer-meta {
            font-size: 0.68rem;
            line-height: 1.45;
        }
    }
</style>
